        "@value": "HEADINGs defined as a data TYPE of 'Record Link' (RL) can be used to link data rows to entries in GROUPs outside of the defined hierarchy (Rule 10c) or DICT group for user defined GROUPs.\nThe GROUP name followed by the KEY FIELDs defining the cross-referenced data row, in the order presented in the AGS4 DATA DICTIONARY.",
